        "procedure": "0.1 mmol H3L, 0.1 mmol Zn(AcO)2·2H2O and 50 μL triethylamine were added to 4 mL absolute ethanol. Then 0.2 mmol Nd(NO3)3·6H2O was added and the mixture was stirred for 1 h. After the solution clarified, 4 mL acetonitrile was added, the mixture was filtered, and allowed to spontaneously volatilize in a 20 mL sealed reaction flask. The flask was placed in an oven at 65 °C for 2 days, affording colorless single crystals of complex 1 (yield 61%).",
